{"seq":1,"slug":"crop-science","title":"作物学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science","introMarkdown":"# 作物学 简介\n\n作物学是农学的核心学科，以人类栽培的主要粮食、经济和饲料作物为研究对象，系统探讨作物的生长发育规律、高产优质的栽培技术、遗传改良方法以及作物与环境之间的互作关系。从一粒种子到一片丰收的田野，作物学串联了从分子遗传到田间管理的完整知识链条，直接关系到粮食安全这一人类最基本的生存需求。\n\n自学者进入作物学领域时会发现，这门学科既有扎实的自然科学基础——植物生理学、遗传学和生态学，又有鲜明的实践导向——每一项研究成果最终都要在农田里接受检验。理论与实践的紧密结合是作物学的显著特征。一个好的作物学研究者既要理解光合作用的生化机制，也要知道什么时候播种、施多少肥、如何应对一场突发的干旱。\n\n第一章**作物栽培学**探讨作物生长发育的基本规律和主要栽培管理措施，帮助理解从播种到收获的全过程调控。第二章**作物育种学**介绍通过遗传改良提高作物产量、品质和抗性的原理与方法，从传统杂交育种到分子标记辅助选择和基因组编辑。第三章**作物生理学**深入分析作物的光合、呼吸、水分和养分代谢过程，以及逆境胁迫下的生理响应机制。第四章**作物生态学**关注作物与光、温、水、土等环境因子的互作关系以及农田生态系统的可持续管理。\n\n建议在学习理论的同时关注实际的农业生产——了解当地的主要作物种植制度、参观农业试验站或阅读农技推广案例，将书本知识与真实的农业实践连接起来。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crop-cultivation","title":"作物栽培学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-cultivation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"soil-nutrient-management","title":"大学作物科学 — 土壤养分管理","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-cultivation/soil-nutrient-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"irrigation-techniques","title":"大学作物科学 — 灌溉技术","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-cultivation/irrigation-techniques"},{"seq":3,"slug":"crop-rotation-systems","title":"大学作物科学 — 轮作制度","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-cultivation/crop-rotation-systems"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"crop-breeding","title":"作物育种学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-breeding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mendelian-genetics","title":"大学作物科学 — 孟德尔遗传学","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-breeding/mendelian-genetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hybridization-methods","title":"大学作物科学 — 杂交育种方法","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-breeding/hybridization-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"molecular-breeding","title":"大学作物科学 — 分子育种","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-breeding/molecular-breeding"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"crop-physiology","title":"作物生理学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-physiology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photosynthesis","title":"大学作物科学 — 光合作用","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-physiology/photosynthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plant-hormones","title":"大学作物科学 — 植物激素","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-physiology/plant-hormones"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stress-physiology","title":"大学作物科学 — 逆境生理学","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-physiology/stress-physiology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"crop-ecology","title":"作物生态学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-ecology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"agroecosystems","title":"大学作物科学 — 农业生态系统","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-ecology/agroecosystems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pest-management","title":"大学作物科学 — 病虫害管理","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-ecology/pest-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sustainable-agriculture","title":"大学作物科学 — 可持续农业","url":"/education/university/agriculture/crop-science/crop-ecology/sustainable-agriculture"}]}]}